<CustomField xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <fullName>Position_Event_Type__c</fullName>
    <description>Provides context for why the debt position was created or subsequently changed.</description>
    <inlineHelpText>Explains why the debt position exists or changed. This is descriptive only.

Primary Commitment = initial creation of the position.
Increase / Upsize = commitment increased under the same loan.
Refinance / Roll-over = loan refinanced or rolled over.
Restructure / Amendment = material amendment where the loan continues.</inlineHelpText>
    <label>Position Event Type</label>
    <required>false</required>
    <trackHistory>false</trackHistory>
    <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
    <type>Picklist</type>
    <valueSet>
        <restricted>true</restricted>
        <valueSetDefinition>
            <sorted>false</sorted>
            <value>
                <fullName>Primary Commitment</fullName>
                <default>false</default>
                <label>Primary Commitment</label>
            </value>
